# Financial model isolation lock

Exactly **two** pipelines. Do not create a third.

## PIPELINE 1 — PLATFORM_COLLECTED

Customer Payment → Payment Sessions → Financial Reconciliation (audit only) → Driver Wallet Ledger → eligible balance → Payout Ledger → bank transfer.

## PIPELINE 2 — DRIVER_COLLECTED_COMMISSION_WALLET

Driver collects customer payment → Commission Wallet atomic reservation → assignment → completion → Commission Wallet deduction/subsidy → Commission Wallet history.

## Never mix

| Operation | PLATFORM_COLLECTED | DRIVER_COLLECTED |
|-----------|--------------------|------------------|
| Payment Session / platform capture | Required | Forbidden |
| Financial Reconciliation | Audit only | Not used |
| TRIP_EARNING_NET / Driver Wallet / Payout Ledger | Allowed | Forbidden |
| Commission Wallet reserve/deduction/subsidy | Forbidden | Allowed |

Reject wrong-model writes with `FINANCIAL_MODEL_VIOLATION`. Never silently drop.

## Stamp

- SA pairing selects the model **only before trip insert**
- `trips.financial_model` is NOT NULL, one of the two values, immutable after insert
- No live SA fallback on financial write paths

Valid SA pairings:

- PLATFORM_COLLECTED + PLATFORM_PREPAID + CW off
- DRIVER_COLLECTED_COMMISSION_WALLET + DRIVER_COLLECTS_UPFRONT + CW on

## Admin Commission Wallet credit

`ADMIN_CREDIT` / promotional / top-up / `trip_id = null` stays Commission Wallet only. Never a customer fare promotion, TEN, or Payout Ledger.

Customer `global_offer`: `gross = pre-promo fare × rate`; `effect = gross − locked promo`. Negative effect → `COMMISSION_SUBSIDY_CREDIT`, never Driver Wallet.

Lock tests: `shared/__tests__/commissionWalletSSOT.test.ts` + `supabase/functions/_shared/financialModelIsolationLock.test.ts`

**If they fail, fix the code — never delete or soften the lock.**
